 of our own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_29","text":"One drastically different from yours.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_30","text":"While we're not sure what exactly form it will assume, it's safe to say it would contain various types of infrastructure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_31","text":"That's beyond our capabilities at the moment, so we're simply constructing the shell.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_32","text":"It's more of a symbolic gesture than anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_33","text":"The Ark is an emblem of rapid progress, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_34","text":"And once you've built this shell? What are you planning on doing then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_35","text":"We're going to make a secret weapon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_36","text":"One that will deal a crushing blow to our enemies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_37","text":"What kind of secret weapon?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_38","text":"Why would I tell you? The entire point of a secret weapon is that it's a secret.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_39","text":"When you say \"our enemies\", are you referring to other Heretics?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_40","text":"Yes, but not the Four Beasts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_41","text":"I'm talking about Nihilister, Liberalio, and Indivilia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"