,"text":"What information do you need?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_49","text":"Oh, right... What was that we need to know, Levi?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_50","text":"*Sigh*... And you were doing so well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_51","text":"You've fought with the Offsprings before, haven't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_52","text":"What were they like?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_53","text":"They possess immense strength.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_54","text":"That goes without saying. You should know by now that's not what I'm curious about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_33_08_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_33_08_55"